    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "czz1vx5",
      "content": "Hockey is the state sport of Odisha. Odisha became the official sponsor of the Indian Men's Hockey Team and Women's Hockey Team. The Kalinga Stadium in Bhubaneswar is India's premier hockey stadium. Odisha also hosted the FIH Men's Hockey World Cup 2018 and 2023."
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Odisha has established itself as the premier global hub for Indian hockey and world-class sports infrastructure.",
      "id": "0vf65xw"
    },
